1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:01,740
You call it lazy.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,640
My whole town does

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,240
it at two o'clock, riposo.

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,299
After lunch, the shutters close

5
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:08,419
and the dogs, eh,

6
00:00:08,419 --> 00:00:09,400
even the dogs lie

7
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,039
down in the middle

8
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:11,039
of the street.

9
00:00:11,039 --> 00:00:13,259
Forty minutes, not three hours.

10
00:00:13,259 --> 00:00:14,539
I'm not a cat.

11
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:15,960
Forty minutes, and I have

12
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,699
the whole afternoon again.

13
00:00:17,699 --> 00:00:18,480
You drink four

14
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,719
coffees to stay awake

15
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:21,199
for a meeting about,

16
00:00:21,199 --> 00:00:21,660
I don't know,

17
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,079
another meeting.

18
00:00:23,079 --> 00:00:24,620
Lie down, amore.

19
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:25,179
The work will

20
00:00:25,179 --> 00:00:26,140
still be there.

21
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:26,920
It always is.

